OL,3,GNEWSA'Miracle' device easing teenager's
OL,4,ATourette symptoms
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor 13-year-old Millie, living with
OL,7,FTourette syndrome has meant far more
OL,8,Fthan occasional tics.
OL,10,FOver the past year, the condition has
OL,11,Faffected her independence, confidence
OL,12,Fand education, forcing her to spend
OL,13,Fmonths away from school.
OL,15,FHowever her family say a new watch-like
OL,16,Fdevice has been transformative.
OL,18,F"I just have a really big fear of being
OL,19,Fjudged," says Millie, from Yarm in
OL,20,FStockton-on-Tees.
